{"seq":13,"slug":"philosophy-of-religion","title":"宗教哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"philosophy-logic","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 宗教哲学\n\n宗教哲学不是神学，也不是宗教学。它不预设任何一种信仰为真，也不像宗教社会学那样满足于描述人们事实上信什么；它要做的，是把宗教信念当作可以被理性追问的命题来对待——上帝这个概念本身是否融贯？说「上帝存在」究竟在断言什么？相信一件没有充分证据的事，是理智的失职还是另有其合法性？这是一门用哲学的工具（逻辑分析、概念澄清、论证评估）去审视宗教这一人类最古老经验的学问，它既向虔信者发问，也向无神论者发问。\n\n把这个 hub 读成一条线索，会看到四段递进。第一段先稳住对象：我们谈论的「上帝」到底是什么。在追问「他存不存在」之前，必须先弄清这个被追问的对象拥有哪些属性、属于哪一种神圣观，以及当我们用人类语言谈论一个超越者时，这些词还有没有意义。概念不清，后面的论证全是空转。\n\n第二段是这门学科最经典的战场：上帝存在的论证。从纯粹靠概念推演的本体论论证，到从宇宙的存在与秩序出发的宇宙论与目的论论证，理性试图为信仰提供地基；而恶的问题则是反方最锋利的一击——如果全善全能的上帝存在，世间何以有如此深重的苦难。正反两方在这里正面交锋。\n\n第三段把视角从「论证」转向「信念的根据」。即便所有证明都不成立，信仰是否仍可正当？这就进入信仰与理性的关系、宗教经验与神秘体验能否作为证据、以及奇迹与启示这类「上帝直接介入」的主张该如何评估。这一段承认：很多人的信仰从来不是靠三段论建立的。\n\n第四段把全部问题拉回当代语境。在一个有众多宗教并存的世界里，凭什么说唯独自己这一支为真？世俗化是否不可逆？新无神论的攻势改变了什么？科学与宗教究竟是冲突、独立还是对话？而死亡与不朽这一最古老的关切，在今天又被神经科学与意识研究重新点燃。\n\n四段连起来，是一条从「概念」到「论证」到「信念根据」再到「当代处境」的完整链条。你不必信教也能读，也不必为了读它而放弃信仰；它要求的只有一样：愿意把最私人的确信，暂时摆到理性的桌面上来看一看。各章引言会进一步交代每一段的内部脉络与彼此的呼应。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"divine-concepts","title":"神圣与上帝概念","docCount":3,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/divine-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"concept-of-god-attributes","title":"上帝概念与神圣属性","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/divine-concepts/concept-of-god-attributes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"theism-pantheism-deism","title":"有神论、泛神论与自然神论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/divine-concepts/theism-pantheism-deism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"religious-language-meaning","title":"宗教语言与意义","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/divine-concepts/religious-language-meaning"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"arguments-existence","title":"上帝存在的论证","docCount":3,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/arguments-existence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ontological-argument","title":"本体论论证","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/arguments-existence/ontological-argument"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cosmological-teleological-arguments","title":"宇宙论与目的论论证","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/arguments-existence/cosmological-teleological-arguments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"problem-of-evil-atheism","title":"恶的问题与无神论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/arguments-existence/problem-of-evil-atheism"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"faith-reason-experience","title":"信仰、理性与经验","docCount":3,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/faith-reason-experience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"faith-and-reason","title":"信仰与理性","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/faith-reason-experience/faith-and-reason"},{"seq":2,"slug":"religious-experience-mysticism","title":"宗教经验与神秘主义","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/faith-reason-experience/religious-experience-mysticism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"miracles-revelation-providence","title":"奇迹、启示与天意","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/faith-reason-experience/miracles-revelation-providence"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"pluralism-contemporary","title":"多元、世俗与当代","docCount":3,"url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/pluralism-contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"religious-pluralism-exclusivism","title":"宗教多元论与排他论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/pluralism-contemporary/religious-pluralism-exclusivism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"secularization-new-atheism","title":"世俗化与新无神论","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/pluralism-contemporary/secularization-new-atheism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"science-religion-death-immortality","title":"科学与宗教、死亡与不朽","url":"/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-religion/pluralism-contemporary/science-religion-death-immortality"}]}]}